Z||000001||Flamberge||10-19-2001||03:05 AM||||I would also be interested in this. I don't know that I would ever do it, (or at least never leave them onwhile actually driving,) but I think deep blue neon underbody lights would look kind of neat on a white Fiero. <P>I asked a car shop (sells car alarms, aftermarket stuff, etc) about them and he said they were so expensive and so fragile, he stopped carrying them. Who knows? I would at least like to try it though. I don't have any pics of my fiero that isn't in broad daylight, otherwise I would photoshop you how it might look.<P>------------------<BR>- Flamberge<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://flamberge.iwarp.com/Serra3sm.jpg"> ||||reg||7
